\pard\f0\fs20\lang1033\par

\cf1\b\fs36 KeyNote NF. Pod\u283?kov\u225?n\u237?\par

\cf0\b0\fs20\par

Jako v\u253?vojov\u253? pokra\u269?ovatel KeyNote 1.6.5 od Marka udr\u382?uje KeyNote NF nad\u225?le stejn\u233? knihovny a komponenty t\u345?et\u237?ch stran, kter\u233? byly sou\u269?\u225?st\u237? t\u233?to verze, a p\u345?id\u225?v\u225? n\u283?kolik dal\u353?\u237?ch. P\u345?ipojuji se k Markovi a d\u283?kuji autor\u367?m t\u283?chto voln\u283? dostupn\u253?ch k\u243?d\u367?: {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<7|1881|0|1"}}{\fldrslt{KeyNote. Pod\u283?kov\u225?n\u237?}}}}}\f0\fs20\par

\par

V KeyNote NF jsou pou\u382?ity nov\u233? knihovny a komponenty. Velk\u233? d\u237?ky jejich autor\u367?m:\par

\par


\pard{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf2\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\fi-360\li360\sa100 Kryvich, b\u283?lorusk\u253? t\u253?m Linguistic Software, za jeho Kryvich Delphi Localizer ({{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK https://sites.google.com/site/kryvich/localizer }}{\fldrslt{https://sites.google.com/site/kryvich/localizer}}}}}\f0\fs20 )\par

{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}Roberto Della Pasqua a p\u345?edchoz\u237? auto\u345?i, za Delphi Fast ZLib 1.2.3 ({{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK http://www.dellapasqua.com/delphizlib/ }}{\fldrslt{http://www.dellapasqua.com/delphizlib/}}}}}\f0\fs20 )\par

{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}Peter Johnson za jeho UWebBrowserWrapper ({{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK http://www.delphidabbler.com/articles?article=14 }}{\fldrslt{http://www.delphidabbler.com/articles?article=14}}}}}\f0\fs20 )\par

{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}Arnaud Bouchez za SynGdiPlus, kter\u253? implementuje potomky TGraphic schopn\u233? na\u269?\u237?tat a ukl\u225?dat obr\u225?zky GIF, TIF, PNG a JPG pomoc\u237? knihovny GDI+ ({{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK http://blog.synopse.info/post/2010/03/20/GIF,-TIF,-PNG-and-JPG-pictures-TGraphic-read/write-via-GDI }}{\fldrslt{http://blog.synopse.info/post/2010/03/20/GIF,-TIF,-PNG-and-JPG-pictures-TGraphic-read/write-via-GDI}}}}}\f0\fs20 )\par

{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}Francois Piette za jeho ICS - Internet Component Suite  ({{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK http://www.overbyte.be/ }}{\fldrslt{http://www.overbyte.be/}}}}}\f0\fs20 )\par

{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}unRxLib, v1.21. Neofici\u225?ln\u237? verze knihovny Rx pro Delphi 2005 a\u382? Alexandria  ({{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK https://www.micrel.cz/RxLib/ }}{\fldrslt{https://www.micrel.cz/RxLib/}}}}}\f0\fs20 )\par

{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}Jordan Russell za Inno Setup ({{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK https://jrsoftware.org/isinfo.php }}{\fldrslt{https://jrsoftware.org/isinfo.php}}}}}\f0\fs20 )\par


\pard\par

A samoz\u345?ejm\u283? d\u237?ky \b Marku Jedlinsk\u233?mu\b0  za KeyNote :)  ({{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK http://www.tranglos.com/free/keynote.html }}{\fldrslt{http://www.tranglos.com/free/keynote.html}}}}}\f0\fs20 )    \par

Tento program, KeyNote NF, je jen jednoduch\u253?m v\u253?vojem KeyNote s \u345?adou vylep\u353?en\u237?.\par

\par

\par

Knihovny a komponenty pou\u382?it\u233? v KeyNote 1.6.5, ale neuveden\u233? v posledn\u237?m seznamu pod\u283?kov\u225?n\u237?. D\u237?ky tak\u233?:\par

\par


\pard{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf2\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\fi-360\li360\sa100 Earl F. Glynn za jeho CRCCalculator\par

{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}Stephan Schneider za jeho TTopMostWindow\par

{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}Alexander Obukhov za komponentu TLanguagesCombo.\par

{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}Mike Lischke za jeho unit StringContainers\par

{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}Peter Johnson za jeho t\u345?\u237?du TWebBrowserWrapper\par

{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}flashpeak@yifan.net za UAS, UltimaShell Autocompletion Server\par


\pard\par

\par

N\u283?kolik komponent a knihoven se v aktu\u225?ln\u237? verzi (1.8.*) nepou\u382?\u237?v\u225?, ale byly pou\u382?ity d\u345?\u237?ve. D\u237?ky jejich autor\u367?m:\par

\par


\pard{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf2\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\fi-360\li360\sa100 Troy Wolbrink za jeho Tnt Unicode Controls ({{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK http://tnt.ccci.org/delphi_unicode_controls/ }}{\fldrslt{http://tnt.ccci.org/delphi_unicode_controls/}}}}}\f0\fs20 )  \par

{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}Delphi Free Stuff od Brada Stowerse ({{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK http://www.delphifreestuff.com }}{\fldrslt{http://www.delphifreestuff.com}}}}}\f0\fs20 ) za TdfsStatusBar\par

{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}Dr. Peter Below za jeho StreamIO, ovlada\u269? za\u345?\u237?zen\u237? pro textov\u233? soubory, kter\u253? umo\u382?\u328?uje I/O ve stylu textov\u253?ch soubor\u367? nad streamy\par


\pard   \par

\par

\par

\cf1\b\v\f1\fs36\lang1045\'11B1\'12\v0 KeyNote.\f0\lang3082  \f1\lang1045  Pod\u283?kov\u225?n\u237?\cf2\f0\lang1033\par

\cf0\b0\fs26\par

\fs20 KeyNote pou\u382?\u237?v\u225? n\u283?kolik freewarov\u253?ch knihoven a komponent, bez nich\u382? by psan\u237? programu bylo nesm\u237?rn\u283? obt\u237?\u382?n\u283?j\u353?\u237?. Auto\u345?i t\u283?chto knihoven poskytuj\u237? komunit\u283? Delphi fantastick\u253? voln\u253? k\u243?d. D\u283?kujeme v\u225?m v\u353?em!\par

\par

\b Tip: \b0 Pokud odkaz v n\u225?sleduj\u237?c\u237?m seznamu nefunguje, v\u283?t\u353?inu nebo v\u353?echny tyto komponenty lze naj\u237?t na {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK http://www.torry.net }}{\fldrslt{http://www.torry.net}}}}}\f0\fs20  nebo pomoc\u237? vyhled\u225?v\u225?n\u237? Google {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK http://www.google.com/ }}{\fldrslt{http://www.google.com/}}}}}\f0\fs20 .\par

\par

\par

\b\fs22 Konkr\u233?tn\u283? bych cht\u283?l pod\u283?kovat t\u283?mto:\b0\par

\fs20\par


\pard{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf2\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\fi-360\li360\sa100 Brada Stowersa za n\u283?kolik b\u225?je\u269?n\u283? u\u382?ite\u269?n\u253?ch komponent, kter\u233? napsal a rozd\u225?v\u225? zdarma: TdfsBrowseDirectoryDlg, TdfsMRUFileList, TdfsStatusBar. Pot\u345?ebn\u233? komponenty jsou distribuov\u225?ny se zdrojov\u253?m k\u243?dem KeyNote a lze je naj\u237?t tak\u233? na {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK http://www.torry.net }}{\fldrslt{http://www.torry.net}}}}}\f0\fs20 .\par

{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}Auto\u345?i knihovny RX Library {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK http://sourceforge.net/projects/rxlib/ }}{\fldrslt{http://sourceforge.net/projects/rxlib/}}}}}\f0\fs20 . \par

{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}Ryan J. Mills za jeho TPage95Control, obrovsk\u233? vylep\u353?en\u237? oproti standardn\u237?mu str\u225?nkov\u233?mu ovl\u225?dac\u237?mu prvku Delphi 3.\par

{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}Wim Coetzee za skv\u283?l\u253? TGFXListBox se za\u353?krt\u225?vac\u237?mi pol\u237?\u269?ky a ikonami.\par

{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}Jordan Russell za jeho naprosto \u250?\u382?asn\u253? ovl\u225?dac\u237? prvek Toolbar97 (panel n\u225?stroj\u367? podobn\u253? MS Office): {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK http://www.jordanr.dhs.org/ }}{\fldrslt{http://www.jordanr.dhs.org/}}}}}\f0\fs20 .\par

{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}Mike Lischke {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK http://www.lischke-online.de/ }}{\fldrslt{http://www.lischke-online.de/}}}}}\f0\fs20  za pokro\u269?ilou komponentu TreeNT, kter\u225? p\u345?id\u225?v\u225? spoustu funkc\u237? a oprav, kter\u233? Borland a Microsoft prost\u283? opomn\u283?li \u8230?\par

{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}David Barton za jeho bal\u237?\u269?ek kryptografick\u253?ch komponent pro Delphi, DCPCrypt {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK http://www.cityinthesky.co.uk/cryptography.html }}{\fldrslt{http://www.cityinthesky.co.uk/cryptography.html}}}}}\f0\fs20 .\par

{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}T\u253?m BitSoft za komponentu TMathParser {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK http://www.bitsoft.com }}{\fldrslt{http://www.bitsoft.com}}}}}\f0\fs20 .\par

{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}Antony Lewis za TFreeWordWeb, integra\u269?n\u237? komponentu WordWeb.\par

{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}Francois Piette za jeho Internet Component Suite {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK http://www.overbyte.be/ }}{\fldrslt{http://www.overbyte.be/}}}}}\f0\fs20 .\par

{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}Gerrit Wolsink za komponentu TRichPrinter.\par

{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}Enzo Costantini za senza\u269?n\u237? tla\u269?\u237?tko pro v\u253?b\u283?r barvy ve stylu MS Office 2000.\par

{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}John Biederman za p\u345?eform\u225?tov\u225?n\u237? a aktualizaci \u269?\u225?st\u237? n\u225?pov\u283?dy pro KeyNote verze 1.6.1.\par


\pard\par

\b A v neposledn\u237? \u345?ad\u283? d\u237?ky Andre v.d. Merwe za jeho p\u367?vodn\u237? program Dart Notes a za inspiraci.\par

\b0\par

}
