{\pntext\f3\'B7\tab}Funkce \b vlo\u382?en\u237? speci\u225?ln\u237?ch znak\u367? \b0 ({\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<23|0|0"}}{\fldrslt{V\u237?ce}}}}\f0\fs20 )\par

{\pntext\f3\'B7\tab}Funkce \u8222?\b sp\u225?rov\u225?n\u237? z\u225?vorek\u8220?\b0 \par

{\pntext\f3\'B7\tab}\b ROT-13\b0 , obr\u225?cen\u237? textu, opakov\u225?n\u237? posledn\u237?ho p\u345?\u237?kazu \u250?prav, spojen\u237? a \u345?azen\u237? \u345?\u225?dk\u367?\u8230?\par

{\pntext\f3\'B7\tab}\b Integrace s programem WordWeb\b0 , bezplatn\u253?m slovn\u237?kem a tezaurem (viz {{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK http://wordweb.co.uk/free }}{\fldrslt{http://wordweb.co.uk/free}}}}\f0\fs20 ) ({\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<26|0|0"}}{\fldrslt{V\u237?ce}}}}\f0\fs20 )\par

{\pntext\f3\'B7\tab}V\u283?t\u353?inu p\u345?\u237?kaz\u367? pro \u250?pravy a form\u225?tov\u225?n\u237? \b lze opakovat\b0  stisknut\u237?m Ctrl+\u199?.\par


