{\pntext\f3\'B7\tab}\b Klikateln\u233? adresy URL\b0  v editoru; u\u382?ivatel\u233? mohou nastavit, co se stane po kliknut\u237? na adresu URL ({\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<38|16878|0|10"}}{\fldrslt{V\u237?ce}}}}\f0\fs20 )\par

{\pntext\f3\'B7\tab}V\u253?choz\u237? \b zv\u283?t\u353?en\u237?\b0  lze nastavit pro v\u353?echny nebo ur\u269?it\u233? soubory. ({\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<20|7487|0|5"}}{\fldrslt{V\u237?ce}}}}\f0\fs20 )\par

{\pntext\f3\'B7\tab}Mo\u382?nost ur\u269?it \b v\u253?choz\u237? vlastnosti pro v\u353?echny nov\u283? vytvo\u345?en\u233? slo\u382?ky\b0  nebo selektivn\u283? pro slo\u382?ky p\u345?idan\u233? do konkr\u233?tn\u237?ho souboru ({\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<30|0|0"}}{\fldrslt{V\u237?ce}}}}\f0\fs20 )\par


\pard\sa100\par

\par


\pard\sa200\fs24 Dal\u353?\u237? funkce\par


\pard{\pntext\f3\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf3\pnindent360{\pntxtb\'B7}}\fi-360\li360\sb100\sa100\f2\fs20\lang3082 Lze definovat v\u237?ce \b alarm\u367?\b0  a p\u345?i\u345?adit je slo\u382?k\u225?m (kart\u225?m) nebo uzl\u367?m ({\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<76|0|0"}}{\fldrslt{V\u237?ce}}}}\f2\fs20 ).\fs24\par


\pard{\pntext\f3\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf3\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\fi-360\li360\sa100\b\f0\fs20\lang1033 Podpora z\u225?suvn\u253?ch modul\u367?\b0  pro roz\u353?\u237?\u345?en\u237? funk\u269?nosti programu ({\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<72|0|0"}}{\fldrslt{V\u237?ce}}}}\f0\fs20 )\par

{\pntext\f3\'B7\tab}\b Podpora maker\b0 , v\u269?etn\u283? maker automaticky spou\u353?t\u283?n\u253?ch p\u345?i vytv\u225?\u345?en\u237? nov\u233?ho souboru nebo p\u345?id\u225?n\u237? slo\u382?ky \u269?i pozn\u225?mky ({\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<71|0|0"}}{\fldrslt{V\u237?ce}}}}\f0\fs20 )\par


\pard{\pntext\f3\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf3\pnindent360{\pntxtb\'B7}}\fi-360\li360\sb100\sa100 Mo\u382?nost \b tisknout \b0 a \b zobrazit n\u225?hled \b0 pozn\u225?mek s pokro\u269?il\u253?mi mo\u382?nostmi ({\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<57|4839|0|13"}}{\fldrslt{V\u237?ce}}}}\f0\fs20 )\par

{\pntext\f3\'B7\tab}\b\f2\lang3082 V\u237?cejazy\u269?n\u225? podpora\b0 , v\u269?etn\u283? jazyk\u367? s psan\u237?m zprava doleva (RTL).\fs24\par

{\pntext\f3\'B7\tab}\b\fs20 Kompatibiln\u237? s Unicode\b0 \fs24\par


\pard{\pntext\f3\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf3\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\fi-360\li360\sa100\f0\fs20\lang1033 Mnoho u\u382?ivatel\u367? m\u367?\u382?e \b sd\u237?let KeyNote na jednom po\u269?\u237?ta\u269?i\b0 , p\u345?i\u269?em\u382? ka\u382?d\u253? u\u382?ivatel m\u367?\u382?e m\u237?t nez\u225?visl\u233? personalizovan\u233? nastaven\u237? ({\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<83|0|0"}}{\fldrslt{V\u237?ce}}}}\f0\fs20 )\par

{\pntext\f3\'B7\tab}Soubory KNT \b lze bezpe\u269?n\u283? sd\u237?let\b0  na \b s\u237?\u357?ov\u233? slo\u382?ce\b0 , co\u382? zaji\u353?\u357?uje, \u382?e je nem\u367?\u382?e upravovat v\u237?ce ne\u382? jeden u\u382?ivatel najednou ({\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<83|0|0"}}{\fldrslt{V\u237?ce}}}}\f0\fs20 )\par

{\pntext\f3\'B7\tab}Automatick\u253? instal\u225?tor a odinstal\u225?tor\par


\pard\sa100\par

\par

Pozn\u225?mka. Aktu\u225?ln\u283? nen\u237? k dispozici, ale je sou\u269?\u225?st\u237? star\u353?\u237?ch verz\u237?:\par


\pard{\pntext\f3\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf3\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\fi-360\li360\sa100 Mo\u382?nost \b odes\u237?lat pozn\u225?mky e-mailem\b0 , v\u269?etn\u283? jednoduch\u233?ho adres\u225?\u345?e a pr\u225?ce s podpisem ({\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<84|0|0"}}{\fldrslt{V\u237?ce}}}}\f0\fs20 )\par


