\pard{\pntext\f10\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf10\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\fi-360\li360 \u268?\u225?ry tabulky m\u367?\u382?ete skr\u253?t tak, \u382?e jim p\u345?i\u345?ad\u237?te barvu shodnou s pozad\u237?m pozn\u225?mky:\par


