\pard\f0\fs20\lang1033\par

\cf1\b\fs36\lang3082 Vlo\u382?it ze schr\u225?nky\cf2\lang1033\par

\cf0\b0\fs20\par

{{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<33|1051|0|1"}}{\fldrslt{Form\u225?tovan\u233? vlo\u382?en\u237?}}}}}\f0\fs20\par

{{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<33|1859|0|2"}}{\fldrslt{Vlo\u382?en\u237? \u8222?\u218?pln\u253? prost\u253? text\u8220?}}}}}\f0\fs20\par

{{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<33|2211|0|3"}}{\fldrslt{Vlo\u382?en\u237? \u8222?Vlastn\u237? prost\u253? text\u8220?}}}}}\f0\fs20\par

{{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<33|2211|0|3"}}{\fldrslt{Vlo\u382?en\u237? HTML}}}}}\f0\fs20\par

\par

{{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<34|0|0"}}{\fldrslt{Webov\u253? v\u253?\u345?ez}}}}}\f0\fs20\par

{{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<35|0|0"}}{\fldrslt{Zachycen\u237? schr\u225?nky}}}}}\f0\fs20\par

\par

\par

KeyNote nab\u237?z\u237? mnoho mo\u382?nost\u237? a voleb p\u345?i vkl\u225?d\u225?n\u237? textu (nebo {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<41|12491|0|19"}}{\fldrslt{obr\u225?zky}}}}}\f0\fs20 ) ze schr\u225?nky.\par

\par

Obsahuje dv\u283? specifick\u233? funkce, ka\u382?dou s vlastn\u237?mi volbami a mechanismy aktivace:\par

\par


\pard 
{\pntext\f0 1.\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlbody\pnf0\pnindent0\pnstart1\pndec{\pntxta.}}
\fi-360\li360 {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<34|0|0"}}{\fldrslt{Webov\u253? v\u253?\u345?ez}}}}}\f0\fs20 , hlavn\u283? pro konfigurovateln\u233? vkl\u225?d\u225?n\u237? textu z prohl\u237?\u382?e\u269?\u367?, aktivovan\u233? z nab\u237?dky a tak\u233? pomoc\u237? \cf3\b Ctrl+W\cf0\b0  nebo \cf4\b Shift\cf3 +Ctrl+W\cf0\b0\par

{\pntext\f0 2.\tab}{{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<35|0|0"}}{\fldrslt{Zachycen\u237? schr\u225?nky}}}}}\f0\fs20 , pro automatick\u233? zachycen\u237? jak\u233?hokoli textu zkop\u237?rovan\u233?ho do schr\u225?nky, aktivovan\u233? pomoc\u237? {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<114|2104|0|7"}}{\fldrslt{Slo\u382?ka | Zachycen\u237? schr\u225?nky}}}}}\f0\fs20 , nebo tla\u269?\u237?tka na panelu n\u225?stroj\u367?: \v\'11I19\'12\v0\lang3082{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "img:19,18,18"}}{\fldrslt {19_Main_19.png}}}}\lang1033  \par


\pard\par

Ob\u283? funkce maj\u237? spole\u269?n\u233? prvky. To je p\u345?irozen\u233?, proto\u382?e prvn\u237? z nich umo\u382?\u328?uje automatick\u233? zachyt\u225?v\u225?n\u237? z jak\u233?hokoli zdroje, v\u269?etn\u283? prohl\u237?\u382?e\u269?\u367?. Podrobnosti o ka\u382?d\u233? z nich najdete na p\u345?edchoz\u237?ch odkazech.\par

\par

Z\u225?rove\u328? ob\u283? funkce z\u225?vis\u237? na dal\u353?\u237?ch obecn\u283?j\u353?\u237?ch a spole\u269?n\u253?ch aspektech vkl\u225?d\u225?n\u237? ze schr\u225?nky, kter\u233? maj\u237? vlastn\u237? mo\u382?nosti konfigurace:\par

\par

\par

\cf5\b\v\fs24\'11B4\'12\v0 Form\u225?tovan\u233? vlo\u382?en\u237? vs. vlo\u382?en\u237? prost\u233?ho textu\cf0\par

\b0\fs20\par


\pard\sa80\cf5\b\v\fs22\'11B1\'12\v0 Form\u225?tovan\u233? vlo\u382?en\u237?\b0\par


\pard\cf0\fs20 KeyNote rozpozn\u225?v\u225? b\u283?\u382?n\u233? kl\u225?vesov\u233? zkratky pou\u382?\u237?van\u233? se schr\u225?nkou, konkr\u233?tn\u283? pro vkl\u225?d\u225?n\u237?:\par

\par

Vlo\u382?it\tab\cf3\b Ctrl+V \cf0\b0 nebo \cf3\b Shift+Insert\cf0\b0\par

M\u367?\u382?ete tak\u233? pou\u382?\u237?t \v\'11I6\'12\v0\lang3082{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "img:6,19,19"}}{\fldrslt {6_Main_06.png}}}}\lang1033  tla\u269?\u237?tko nebo {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<110|5282|0|7"}}{\fldrslt{\u218?pravy | Vlo\u382?it}}}}}\f0\fs20\par


\pard\li360\sb120\b Tip\b0 : P\u345?i kliknut\u237? na toto tla\u269?\u237?tko nebo polo\u382?ku nab\u237?dky m\u367?\u382?ete podr\u382?et Ctrl, Shift nebo Alt a z\u237?skat tak jin\u253? druh vlo\u382?en\u237?. Viz: {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<82|450|0|1"}}{\fldrslt{Alternativn\u237? p\u345?\u237?kazy Shift, Alt nebo Ctrl}}}}}\f0\fs20\par


\pard\par

V\u353?echny tyto akce odpov\u237?daj\u237? b\u283?\u382?n\u233?mu vlo\u382?en\u237?, tedy vlo\u382?en\u237? s pln\u253?m form\u225?tov\u225?n\u237?m, p\u345?i kter\u233?m se zachov\u225? p\u367?vodn\u237? p\u237?smo a form\u225?tov\u225?n\u237? odstavc\u367? vlo\u382?en\u233?ho textu (nebo form\u225?tov\u225?n\u237? RTF vznikl\u233? p\u345?evodem HTML na RTF)\par


\pard\sb100\ul Pozn\u225?mka\ulnone :\par


\pard{\pntext\f3\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf3\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\fi-360\li360\sb100 \u8222?Clipboard Capture\u8220? a \u8222?Web Clip\u8220? tak\u233? umo\u382?\u328?uj\u237? vlo\u382?it pln\u283? form\u225?tovan\u253? text.\par

{\pntext\f3\'B7\tab}Tyto akce mohou tak\u233? prov\u233?st vlo\u382?en\u237? \u8222?pln\u283? prost\u233?ho\u8220? nebo \u8222?vlastn\u237?ho prost\u233?ho\u8220? textu (viz n\u237?\u382?e), kdy\u382? je povolena volba {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<101|185|0|4"}}{\fldrslt{Vlo\u382?en\u237? extern\u237?ho obsahu jako prost\u233?ho textu}}}}}\f0\fs20 .\par


\pard{\pntext\f3\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf3\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\fi-360\li360\sb60 P\u345?i vkl\u225?d\u225?n\u237? do pozn\u225?mky s prost\u253?m textem se ve v\u253?choz\u237?m nastaven\u237? pou\u382?ije \u8222?pln\u283? prost\u253?\u8220? re\u382?im (tak\u233? u \u8222?Clipboard Capture\u8220? a \u8222?Web Clip\u8220?).\par

{\pntext\f3\'B7\tab}Obsahuje-li schr\u225?nka n\u283?kolik form\u225?t\u367?, d\u225? KeyNote p\u345?ednost RTF p\u345?ed ostatn\u237?mi form\u225?ty, je-li k dispozici.\par


\pard\li360\sb60 Kdy\u382? nap\u345?\u237?klad zkop\u237?rujete oblast bun\u283?k aplikace Excel, vlo\u382?\u237? se jako tabulka (RTF). Chcete-li vlo\u382?it jako obr\u225?zek, m\u367?\u382?ete pou\u382?\u237?t \b Vlo\u382?it ostatn\u237?\b0 .\par


\pard\sb60\par


\pard\par


\pard\sb100\sa80\cf5\b\v\fs22\'11B2\'12\v0 Vlo\u382?en\u237? \u8222?pln\u283? prost\u233?ho\u8220? textu\b0\par


\pard\cf0\fs20 Vkl\u225?dat m\u367?\u382?ete tak\u233? s ignorov\u225?n\u237?m ve\u353?ker\u233?ho st\u225?vaj\u237?c\u237?ho form\u225?tov\u225?n\u237?:\par

\par

Vlo\u382?it jako text\tab\cf4\b Shift\cf3 +Ctrl+V \cf0\b0 nebo \cf4\b Ctrl\cf3 +Shift+Insert\cf0\b0\par

M\u367?\u382?ete tak\u233? pou\u382?\u237?t {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<110|5597|0|9"}}{\fldrslt{\u218?pravy | Vlo\u382?it jin\u233?...| Vlo\u382?it jako text}}}}}\f0\fs20  (nebo dokonce {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<110|5719|0|10"}}{\fldrslt{Vlo\u382?it jin\u233?...}}}}}\f0\fs20 ) a \v\'11I121\'12\v0\lang3082{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "img:121,45,27"}}{\fldrslt {121_Clipb_06ene.png}}}}\lang1033  a zvolit volbu \u8222?Vlo\u382?it jako text\u8220?.\par

\par

\par


\pard\sb100\sa80\cf5\b\v\fs22\'11B3\'12\v0 Vlo\u382?en\u237? \u8222?vlastn\u237?ho prost\u233?ho\u8220? textu\b0\par


\pard\sa80\cf0\fs20 KeyNote NF obsahuje volbu {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<101|678|0|5"}}{\fldrslt{Re\u382?im prost\u233?ho textu}}}}}\f0\fs20 , kter\u225? v\u225?m umo\u382?n\u237? zachovat \u269?\u225?st form\u225?tov\u225?n\u237? textu ve schr\u225?nce. Tato volba se bere v \u250?vahu v n\u225?sleduj\u237?c\u237?ch situac\u237?ch:\par


\pard{\pntext\f3\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf3\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\fi-360\li360 {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<101|185|0|4"}}{\fldrslt{Vlo\u382?en\u237? extern\u237?ho obsahu v \u8222?Re\u382?imu prost\u233?ho textu\u8220?}}}}}\f0\fs20\par

{\pntext\f3\'B7\tab}{{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<35|0|0"}}{\fldrslt{Zachycen\u237? schr\u225?nky}}}}}\f0\fs20 , pokud je povolena jej\u237? vlastn\u237? volba {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<101|2766|0|6"}}{\fldrslt{Vlo\u382?en\u237? v \u8222?Re\u382?imu prost\u233?ho textu\u8220?}}}}}\f0\fs20 .\par

{\pntext\f3\'B7\tab}{{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<34|0|0"}}{\fldrslt{Webov\u253? v\u253?\u345?ez}}}}}\f0\fs20 , pokud se prov\u225?d\u237? v re\u382?imu prost\u233?ho textu pomoc\u237? \cf4\b Shift\cf3 +Ctrl+W \cf0\b0 (nam\u237?sto \cf3\b Ctrl+W\cf0\b0  )\par


\pard\par

* Pamatujte: Kdy\u382? se provede Vlo\u382?it jako text (Shift+Ctrl+Insert nebo Shift+Ctrl+V), v\u382?dy se pou\u382?ije pln\u283? prost\u253? text\par

\par

\par

\par

\cf5\b\v\fs24\'11B5\'12\v0 Vkl\u225?d\u225?n\u237? HTML\b0\par

\cf0\fs20\par

V\u382?dy, kdy\u382? KeyNote p\u345?i vkl\u225?d\u225?n\u237? ze schr\u225?nky zjist\u237? p\u345?\u237?tomnost obsahu ve form\u225?tu HTML, zkontroluje, zda nen\u237? z\u225?rove\u328? nab\u237?zen obsah ve form\u225?tu RTF. Pokud tomu tak nen\u237?, provede p\u345?evod a p\u345?id\u225? jej do schr\u225?nky.\par

\par

T\u237?mto zp\u367?sobem m\u367?\u382?ete p\u345?i kop\u237?rov\u225?n\u237? a vkl\u225?d\u225?n\u237? obsahu z prohl\u237?\u382?e\u269?e za\u269?lenit \b ve\u353?ker\u233? form\u225?tov\u225?n\u237? textu\b0 , p\u345?i\u269?em\u382? st\u225?le m\u367?\u382?ete prov\u233?st \b\i pln\u283?\i0  \i prost\u233?\b0\i0  nebo \b\i vlastn\u237? prost\u233?\i0  \b0\i vlo\u382?en\u237?\i0  a vyu\u382?\u237?t mo\u382?nost\u237? uveden\u253?ch v\u253?\u353?e.\par

\par

Pou\u382?it\u237? vlastn\u237?ho vlo\u382?en\u237? je ve skute\u269?nosti obzvl\u225?\u353?t\u283? v\u253?hodn\u233? p\u345?i kop\u237?rov\u225?n\u237? a vkl\u225?d\u225?n\u237? textu z webov\u253?ch str\u225?nek, proto\u382?e n\u225?m umo\u382?\u328?uje zahrnout hypertextov\u233? odkazy a styl p\u237?sma (tu\u269?n\u233?, kurz\u237?va, ...) \f1\emdash nebo dal\u353?\u237? mo\u382?nosti\emdash\f0\lang3082  \f1\lang1033 , ani\u382? bychom zm\u283?nili form\u225?tov\u225?n\u237? odstavc\u367? nebo dokonce typ zdroje, pokud o to m\u225?me z\u225?jem.\f0\par

\par

\b Tip\b0 : V nab\u237?dce Upravit | Vlo\u382?it jinak... m\u367?\u382?eme v\u382?dy z form\u225?t\u367? dostupn\u253?ch ve schr\u225?nce vybrat ten, kter\u253? pot\u345?ebujeme. T\u237?mto zp\u367?sobem m\u367?\u382?ete vlo\u382?it nap\u345?\u237?klad \b zdrojov\u253? HTML\b0 .\par

\par


\pard{\pntext\f3\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf3\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\fi-360\li360 P\u345?i vkl\u225?d\u225?n\u237? z HTML (webov\u253?ch str\u225?nek) se jako v\u253?choz\u237? hodnoty pou\u382?ij\u237? aktu\u225?ln\u237? p\u237?smo a velikost v aktivn\u237?m editoru nam\u237?sto obvykl\u233?ho Times New Roman 12.\par


\pard\li360 * Aktu\u225?ln\u237? p\u237?smo na webov\u233? str\u225?nce se pou\u382?ije, pokud je v\u253?slovn\u283? definov\u225?no.\f2\lang3082\par


\pard{\pntext\f3\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf3\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\fi-360\li360\sb80\f0\lang1033 Tip: \ul MS Sans Serif\ulnone  nezobrazuje v\u353?echny znaky Unicode. Zkuste nap\u345?\u237?klad p\u237?smo TrueType, jako je Tahoma.\par


\pard\f2\lang3082\par


\pard\fi-560\li560\sb40\b\f0\lang1033 Tip\b0 : Od verze 2.0 m\u367?\u382?ete vkl\u225?dat \u250?ryvky z webov\u253?ch prohl\u237?\u382?e\u269?\u367?, kter\u233? obsahuj\u237? \b text i obr\u225?zky\b0 .\par


\pard\f2\lang3082\par

\par

\ul Omezen\u237?\ulnone :\par


\pard{\pntext\f3\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf3\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\fi-360\li360\sb100 Existuj\u237? \b n\u283?kter\u233? webov\u233? str\u225?nky\b0 , u nich\u382? \b p\u345?evod\b0  z HTML \b do RTF nen\u237? v po\u345?\u225?dku\b0  a m\u367?\u382?e v\u233?st k pr\u225?zdn\u233?mu v\u253?sledku nebo ke zkr\u225?cen\u237? \u269?\u225?sti textu.\par


\pard{\pntext\f3\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf3\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\fi-360\li720\sb100 KeyNote v takov\u233?m p\u345?\u237?pad\u283? vlo\u382?\u237? text z dan\u233?ho zachycen\u237? jako pln\u283? prost\u253? text (bez jak\u233?hokoli form\u225?tov\u225?n\u237?), kdy\u382? tento probl\u233?m zjist\u237?.\par


\pard{\pntext\f3\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf3\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\fi-360\li720\sb60 P\u345?evod HTML zkop\u237?rovan\u233?ho do schr\u225?nky z n\u283?kter\u253?ch str\u225?nek do RTF (prov\u225?d\u283?n\u253? pomoc\u237? TWebBrowser) je zcela nebo \u269?\u225?ste\u269?n\u283? nespr\u225?vn\u253? (dokonce ani MS Word nedok\u225?\u382?e tyto fragmenty p\u345?ev\u233?st spr\u225?vn\u283?).\par

{\pntext\f3\'B7\tab}Tento probl\u233?m jsem zaznamenal u ur\u269?it\u253?ch fragment\u367? na n\u225?sleduj\u237?c\u237?m webu, jeho\u382? HTML se zd\u225? b\u253?t podivn\u233?: \ul stackoverflow.com\ulnone . M\u367?\u382?e se v\u353?ak vyskytnout i na jin\u253?ch webech.\f0\lang1033\par


\pard\li720\sb60 Zva\u382?te nap\u345?\u237?klad n\u225?sleduj\u237?c\u237? URL adresy a zkuste zkop\u237?rovat a vlo\u382?it n\u283?kolik odstavc\u367? najednou.\par


\pard\li720   {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK https://stackoverflow.com/questions/46991729/how-to-load-a-stringstream-with-utf8-characters-to-a-stringlist-in-android }}{\fldrslt{https://stackoverflow.com/questions/46991729/how-to-load-a-stringstream-with-utf8-characters-to-a-stringlist-in-android}}}}}\f0\fs20\par

  {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK https://stackoverflow.com/questions/11122197/why-does-memo-lines-use-tstrings-instead-of-tstringlist }}{\fldrslt{https://stackoverflow.com/questions/11122197/why-does-memo-lines-use-tstrings-instead-of-tstringlist}}}}}\f0\fs20\par

\par

V\u283?t\u353?ina z nich vytvo\u345?\u237? '<>' nebo '', jin\u233? '<<<' nebo n\u283?co podobn\u233?ho a n\u283?kter\u233? mohou zkr\u225?tit \u269?\u225?st textu. Pokud v t\u283?chto p\u345?\u237?kladech kop\u237?rujeme (a vkl\u225?d\u225?me) pouze fragmenty ur\u269?it\u253?ch odstavc\u367? nebo jen \u250?ryvky k\u243?du, zd\u225? se to b\u253?t v po\u345?\u225?dku.\par


\pard\par

}
