\pard\sb100\sa100\f1\fs20 V tomto p\u345?\u237?kladu je v \cf2\b Z\u225?hlav\u237? d\u233?lky\cf0\b0  dekrement 0, a tak by v\u353?echny \u345?\u225?dky se symboly m\u283?ly dos\u225?hnout stejn\u233? maxim\u225?ln\u237? hodnoty (80), ale proto\u382?e je zapnuto \cf2\b Odsazovat uzly\cf0\b0  a TabSize=4 (a tak\u233? \cf2\b Zvy\u353?ovat odsazen\u237? o\cf0\b0 = 12 a \cf2\b Odsazen\u237?\cf0\b0 =24) v pozn\u225?mce, odebere se z ka\u382?d\u233? nov\u233? \u250?rovn\u283? 8 znak\u367?.\par


\pard M\u367?\u382?ete si v\u353?imnout, \u382?e \u345?\u225?dky nevypadaj\u237? stejn\u283? dlouh\u233?. Je to zp\u367?sobeno pou\u382?it\u237?m tabul\u225?toru a t\u237?m, \u382?e prostor zabran\u253? 1 TAB se p\u345?esn\u283? neshoduje se 4 mezerami. Pokud tento text zkop\u237?rujete a vlo\u382?\u237?te do Notepad++ nebo Notepad2 s nastaven\u237?m 1 Tab = 4 mezery, uvid\u237?te, \u382?e konce vypadaj\u237? zarovnan\u233?.\par


\pard\sb80 V budouc\u237?ch verz\u237?ch se to pokus\u237?me vy\u345?e\u353?it, jak je po\u382?adov\u225?no v {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://github.com/dpradov/keynote-nf/issues/615"}}{\fldrslt{Povolit konfiguraci zar\u225?\u382?ek tabul\u225?toru (snaha sladit TAB se \u269?ty\u345?mi mezerami)}}}}}\f1\fs20\par


\pard\par

