\pard\f0\fs20\lang1033\par

\cf1\b\f1\fs36\lang1045 Makra v KeyNote\cf0\b0\f0\fs20\lang1033\par

\par

Makra jsou zobrazena na panelu zdroj\u367?. Stisknut\u237?m \cf2\b F9\cf0\b0  zobraz\u237?te panel zdroj\u367?.\par

\par

{{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<71|157|0|1"}}{\fldrslt{Obecn\u233? informace o makrech}}}}}\f0\fs20\par

{{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<71|1718|0|2"}}{\fldrslt{Panel n\u225?stroj\u367? maker}}}}}\f0\fs20\par

