\pard\cf0\par

Viz tak\u233? {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<85|0|0"}}{\fldrslt{Konfigurace p\u345?ehledu KeyNote}}}}}\f0\fs20\par

\par

V\u353?imn\u283?te si, \u382?e n\u283?kter\u225? nastaven\u237? konfigurace nelze v existuj\u237?c\u237?m dialogov\u233?m okn\u283? Mo\u382?nosti upravit. Tato dodate\u269?n\u225? nastaven\u237? lze upravit zm\u283?nou konfigura\u269?n\u237?ho souboru KeyNote, keynote.ini. (V\u237?ce v {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<104|0|0"}}{\fldrslt{Dal\u353?\u237? nastaven\u237? KeyNote.ini}}}}}\f0\fs20 )\par

\par

