\cf3\b\par

\cf1\v\fs26\'11B2\'12\v0 Zp\u283?t\cf3\fs20\par

\cf0\b0 Vr\u225?t\u237? zp\u283?t (zru\u353?\u237?) naposledy provedenou edita\u269?n\u237? operaci. \par

Dialogov\u233? okno Mo\u382?nosti umo\u382?\u328?uje zadat \u8222?\u250?rove\u328? zp\u283?t\u8220?, tj. po\u269?et edita\u269?n\u237?ch operac\u237?, kter\u233? lze vr\u225?tit zp\u283?t (viz {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<89|0|0"}}{\fldrslt{Mo\u382?nosti: Editor RTF}}}}}\f0\fs20 ).\par

\par


