\cf0\b0 Zvr\u225?t\u237? posledn\u237? p\u345?\u237?kaz Zp\u283?t.\par

\par


\pard\li240\v\'11I14\'12\v0\lang3082{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "img:14,16,16"}}{\fldrslt {14_Main_14.png}}}}\lang1033  \cf4\f2\lang3082 TB_EditRedo\tab\tab\cf5\b\f0\fs18\lang1033 Ctrl+Enter\f2\fs20  \cf0\b0 / \cf4 MMEditRedo\cf5\b\par


\pard\cf0\b0\f0\par

\par

\cf1\b\v\fs26\'11B4\'12\v0 Opakovat posledn\u237?\cf3\fs20\par

\cf0\b0 Zopakuje posledn\u237? edita\u269?n\u237? p\u345?\u237?kaz. \par

Vedle p\u345?\u237?kazu nab\u237?dky zobrazuje KeyNote p\u345?\u237?kaz, kter\u253? bude zopakov\u225?n, nap\u345?. \ldblquote Opakovat tu\u269?n\u233?\rdblquote , \ldblquote Opakovat odstavec\rdblquote  nebo \ldblquote Opakovat vlo\u382?en\u237?\rdblquote . To je u\u382?ite\u269?n\u233? zejm\u233?na tehdy, kdy\u382? je p\u345?\u237?kaz, kter\u253? chcete opakovat, ulo\u382?en hloub\u283?ji ve struktu\u345?e nab\u237?dky. Posledn\u237? edita\u269?n\u237? p\u345?\u237?kaz m\u367?\u382?ete zopakovat tak\u233? stisknut\u237?m \cf5\b\fs18 Ctrl+\u199?\cf0\b0\fs20 .\par


\pard\li360\sb80\b Tip\b0 : Aktu\u225?ln\u237? kl\u225?vesovou zkratku zjist\u237?te v polo\u382?ce \u218?pravy|Opakovat.., proto\u382?e dan\u253? znak z\u225?vis\u237? na rozlo\u382?en\u237? va\u353?\u237? kl\u225?vesnice.\par


\pard\par


\pard\li240\v\'11I41\'12\v0\lang3082{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "img:41,16,16"}}{\fldrslt {41_Main_41.png}}}}\lang1033  \cf4\f2\lang3082 TB_Repeat\tab\tab\cf5\b\f0\fs18\lang1033 Ctrl+\u199?\f2\fs20  \cf0\b0 / \cf4 MMEditRepeat\cf5\b\par


\pard\cf0\b0\f0\par

\par

\cf1\b\v\fs26\'11B5\'12\v0 Vyjmout\cf3\fs20\par

\cf0\b0 Vy\u345?\u237?zne vybran\u253? text a um\u237?st\u237? jej do schr\u225?nky.\par

\par


\pard\li240\v\'11I4\'12\v0\lang3082{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "img:4,16,16"}}{\fldrslt {4_Main_04.png}}}}\lang1033  \cf4\f2\lang3082 TB_EditCut\tab\tab\cf5\b\f0\fs18\lang1033 Ctrl+X\cf0\b0  nebo \cf5\b Shift+Delete\f2\fs20  \cf0\b0 / \cf4 MMEditCut\cf5\b\par


\pard\cf0\b0\f0\par

\par

\cf1\b\v\fs26\'11B6\'12\v0 Kop\u237?rovat\cf3\fs20\par

\cf0\b0 Zkop\u237?ruje vybran\u253? text a um\u237?st\u237? jej do schr\u225?nky.\par

\par


\pard\li240\v\'11I5\'12\v0\lang3082{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "img:5,16,16"}}{\fldrslt {5_Main_05.png}}}}\lang1033  \cf4\f2\lang3082 TB_EditCopy\tab\tab\cf5\b\f0\fs18\lang1033 Ctrl+C\f2\fs20  \cf0\b0 / \cf4 MMEditCopy\cf5\b\par


\pard\cf0\b0\f0\par

\par

\cf1\b\v\fs26\'11B7\'12\v0 Vlo\u382?it\cf3\fs20\par

\cf0\b0 Vlo\u382?\u237? data ze schr\u225?nky. Upozor\u328?ujeme, \u382?e m\u367?\u382?ete vlo\u382?it nejen text, ale tak\u233? jin\u233? datov\u233? form\u225?ty, kter\u233? schr\u225?nka Windows m\u367?\u382?e obsahovat, nap\u345?. obr\u225?zky.\par

\par


\pard\li240\v\'11I6\'12\v0\lang3082{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "img:6,16,16"}}{\fldrslt {6_Main_06.png}}}}\lang1033  \cf4\f2\lang3082 TB_EditPaste\tab\tab\cf5\b\f0\fs18\lang1033 Ctrl+V\cf0\b0  nebo \cf5\b Shift+Insert\f2\fs20  \cf0\b0 / \cf4 MMEditPaste\cf5\b\par


\pard\cf0\b0\f0\par

\par

\cf1\b\v\fs26\'11B8\'12\v0 Vlo\u382?it jin\u233?\cf3\fs20\par

\cf0\b0 Zobraz\u237? podnab\u237?dku p\u345?\u237?kaz\u367? pro vkl\u225?d\u225?n\u237? do KeyNote ze schr\u225?nky.\par

 \par

\cf1\b\v\fs26\'11B9\'12\v0 Vlo\u382?it jako text\cf3\fs20\par

\cf0\b0 Vlo\u382?\u237? text ze schr\u225?nky jako prost\u253? text (bez jak\u233?hokoli form\u225?tov\u225?n\u237?)\par

\par


\pard\li240\cf5\b\fs18 Shift+Ctrl+Ins\f2\fs20  \cf0\b0 / \cf4 MMEditPasteAsText\cf5\b\par


\pard\cf0\b0\f0\par

\par

\cf1\b\v\fs26\'11B39\'12\v0 Vlo\u382?it jako webov\u253? v\u253?st\u345?i\u382?ek\cf3\fs20\par

\cf0\b0 Vlo\u382?\u237? text z extern\u237?ch program\u367? (nap\u345?. prohl\u237?\u382?e\u269?\u367?) konfigurovateln\u253?m zp\u367?sobem, co\u382? umo\u382?\u328?uje p\u345?idat k z\u225?znamu kontextov\u233? informace, jako je \u269?as, URL nebo n\u225?zev.\par


\pard\sb80 Zahrne ve\u353?ker\u233? form\u225?tov\u225?n\u237? zdrojov\u233?ho textu\par


\pard\par


\pard\sb80 Viz tak\u233? {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<34|0|0"}}{\fldrslt{Pou\u382?\u237?v\u225?n\u237? Web clip}}}}}\f0\fs20\par


\pard\par


\pard\li240\cf5\b\fs18 Ctrl+W \cf0\b0\f2\fs20 / \cf4 MMEditPasteAsWebClip\cf5\b\par


\pard\cf0\b0\f0\par

\par

\cf1\b\v\fs26\'11B40\'12\v0 Vlo\u382?it jako webov\u253? v\u253?st\u345?i\u382?ek (text)\cf3\fs20\par

\cf0\b0 Vlo\u382?\u237? text z extern\u237?ch program\u367? (nap\u345?. prohl\u237?\u382?e\u269?\u367?) konfigurovateln\u253?m zp\u367?sobem, co\u382? umo\u382?\u328?uje p\u345?idat k z\u225?znamu kontextov\u233? informace, jako je \u269?as, URL nebo n\u225?zev.\par


\pard\sb80 Umo\u382?\u328?uje {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<33|2492|0|3"}}{\fldrslt{Vlo\u382?en\u237? \u8222?Vlastn\u237? prost\u253? text\u8220?}}}}}\f0\fs20 , kter\u253? v z\u225?vislosti na tom, zda je nakonfigurov\u225?n v {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<101|678|0|5"}}{\fldrslt{Re\u382?im prost\u233?ho textu}}}}}\f0\fs20 , nab\u237?dne \u250?pln\u233? vlo\u382?en\u237? prost\u233?ho textu, nebo zahrne ur\u269?it\u233? aspekty form\u225?tov\u225?n\u237?.\par

Viz tak\u233? {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<34|0|0"}}{\fldrslt{Pou\u382?\u237?v\u225?n\u237? Web clip}}}}}\f0\fs20\par


\pard\par


\pard\li240\cf5\b\fs18 Shift+Ctrl+W\f2\fs20  \cf0\b0 / \cf4 MMEditPasteAsWebClipText\cf5\b\par


\pard\cf0\b0\f0\par

\par

\cf1\b\v\fs26\'11B10\'12\v0 Vlo\u382?it jinak\cf3\fs20\par

\cf0\b0 Zobraz\u237? standardn\u237? dialogov\u233? okno Windows \u8222?Vlo\u382?it jinak\u8220?, kter\u233? umo\u382?\u328?uje vybrat form\u225?t, kter\u253? se m\u225? pou\u382?\u237?t pro vlo\u382?en\u237? dat ze schr\u225?nky.\par

\par


\pard\li240\cf4\f2 MMEditPasteSpecial\cf5\b\par


\pard\cf0\b0\f0\par

\par

\cf1\b\v\fs26\'11B11\'12\v0 Vlo\u382?it do nov\u233? slo\u382?ky\cf3\fs20\par

\cf0\b0 Vytvo\u345?\u237? novou slo\u382?ku a vlo\u382?\u237? do n\u237? data ze schr\u225?nky.\par

\par


\pard\li240\cf4\f2 MMEditPasteAsNewNote\cf5\b\par


\pard\cf0\b0\f0\par

\par

\cf1\b\v\fs26\'11B12\'12\v0 Vlo\u382?it do nov\u233?ho uzlu\cf3\fs20\par

\cf0\b0 Vytvo\u345?\u237? nov\u253? uzel v aktu\u225?ln\u237? slo\u382?ce a vlo\u382?\u237? do n\u283?j data ze schr\u225?nky. N\u225?zev nov\u233?ho uzlu je stejn\u253? jako vlo\u382?en\u253? text.\par

\par


\pard\li240\cf4\f2 MMEditPasteAsNewNode\cf5\b\par


\pard\cf0\b0\f0\par

\par

\cf1\b\v\fs26\'11B13\'12\v0 Odstranit\cf3\fs20\par

\cf0\b0 Odstran\u237? vybran\u253? text.\par

\par


\pard\li240\cf4\f2 MMEditDelete\cf5\b\par


\pard\cf0\b0\f0\par

\par

\cf1\ul\b\v\fs26\'11B14\'12\v0 \u344?\u225?dky\cf3\ulnone\fs20\par

\cf0\b0 Zobraz\u237? podnab\u237?dku s p\u345?\u237?kazy pro pr\u225?ci s \u345?\u225?dky textu.\par

 \par

\cf1\b\v\fs26\'11B15\'12\v0 Odstranit \u345?\u225?dek\cf3\fs20\par

\cf0\b0 Odstran\u237? \u345?\u225?dek, na kter\u233?m je kurzor.\par

\par


\pard\li240\cf5\b\fs18 Ctrl+Y\f2\fs20  \cf0\b0 / \cf4 MMEditDelLine\cf5\b\par


\pard\cf0\b0\f0\par

\par

\cf1\b\v\fs26\'11B16\'12\v0 Se\u345?adit \u345?\u225?dky\cf3\fs20\par

\cf0\b0 Se\u345?ad\u237? aktu\u225?ln\u283? vybran\u233? \u345?\u225?dky v alfanumerick\u233?m po\u345?ad\u237?.\par

\par


\pard\li240\cf5\b\fs18 Shift+Ctrl+S\f2\fs20  \cf0\b0 / \cf4 MMEditSort\cf5\b\par


\pard\li360\sb120\cf0\f0 Tip\b0 : Tento p\u345?\u237?kaz lze pou\u382?\u237?t tak\u233? k \u345?azen\u237? blok\u367? textu pomoc\u237? skl\u225?d\u225?n\u237?. Slo\u382?en\u253? blok textu bude se\u345?azen podle viditeln\u233?ho v\u253?\u328?atku (s ignorov\u225?n\u237?m znaku \f3\u10133?\f0 ). Obsah slo\u382?en\u233?ho textu nebude zm\u283?n\u283?n (dokud je slo\u382?en\u253?/skryt\u253?).\par


\pard\par

\cf1\b\v\fs26\'11B17\'12\v0 Spojit \u345?\u225?dky\cf3\fs20\par

\cf0\b0 Odstran\u237? konce \u345?\u225?dk\u367? ve vybran\u253?ch \u345?\u225?dc\u237?ch a spoj\u237? je do jedin\u233?ho \u345?\u225?dku.\par

\par


\pard\li240\cf5\b\fs18 Ctrl+J\f2\fs20  \cf0\b0 / \cf4 MMEditJoin\cf5\b\par


\pard\li360\sb80\cf0\f0 Tip\b0 : Tento p\u345?\u237?kaz m\u367?\u382?e ke spojen\u237? pou\u382?\u237?t vlastn\u237? \u345?et\u283?zec m\u237?sto v\u253?choz\u237? mezery, co\u382? umo\u382?\u328?uje (nap\u345?.): 'L1', 'L2', ...\par


\pard\li720 Viz {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<20|30336|0|17"}}{\fldrslt{Spojov\u225?n\u237? v\u237?ce \u345?\u225?dk\u367? pomoc\u237? vlastn\u237?ho \u345?et\u283?zce jako odd\u283?lova\u269?e}}}}}\f0\fs20\par


\pard\sb40\par


\pard\cf1\ul\b\v\fs26\'11B18\'12\v0 Zm\u283?nit velikost p\u237?smen\cf3\ulnone\fs20\par

\cf0\b0 Zobraz\u237? podnab\u237?dku s p\u345?\u237?kazy pro zm\u283?nu velikosti p\u237?smen vybran\u233?ho textu.\par

\cf3\b\f4\fs26\par

\cf1\v\f0\'11B19\'12\v0 Na VELK\u193? P\u205?SMENA\cf3\fs20\par

\cf0\b0 Zm\u283?n\u237? vybran\u253? text na v\u353?echna velk\u225? p\u237?smena.\par

\par


\pard\li240\cf5\b\fs18 Shift+Ctrl+U\f2\fs20  \cf0\b0 / \cf4 MMEditUpper\cf5\b\par


\pard\cf0\b0\f0\par

\par

\cf1\b\v\fs26\'11B20\'12\v0 Na mal\u225? p\u237?smena\cf3\fs20\par

\cf0\b0 Zm\u283?n\u237? vybran\u253? text na v\u353?echna mal\u225? p\u237?smena.\par

\par


\pard\li240\cf5\b\fs18 Shift+Ctrl+L\f2\fs20  \cf0\b0 / \cf4 MMEditLower\cf5\b\par


\pard\cf0\b0\f0\par

\par

\cf1\b\v\fs26\'11B21\'12\v0 Na sm\u237?\u353?en\u225? p\u237?smena\cf3\fs20\par

\cf0\b0 Zm\u283?n\u237? vybran\u253? text na sm\u237?\u353?en\u225? p\u237?smena (prvn\u237? p\u237?smeno ka\u382?d\u233?ho slova je velk\u233?, ostatn\u237? p\u237?smena mal\u225?). \par

KeyNote se zm\u283?n\u237? na Keynote.\par

\par


\pard\li240\cf5\b\fs18 Shift+Ctrl+M\f2\fs20  \cf0\b0 / \cf4 MMEditMixed\cf5\b\par


\pard\cf0\b0\f0\par

\par

\cf1\b\v\fs26\'11B22\'12\v0 Obr\u225?tit velikost p\u237?smen\cf3\fs20\par

\cf0\b0 Zam\u283?n\u237? velk\u225? a mal\u225? p\u237?smena\par

(KeyNote se zm\u283?n\u237? na kEYnOTE).\par

\par


\pard\li240\cf5\b\fs18 Shift+Ctrl+I\f2\fs20  \cf0\b0 / \cf4 MMEditInvertCase\cf5\b\par


\pard\cf0\b0\f0\par

\par

\cf1\b\v\fs26\'11B23\'12\v0 Cyklicky m\u283?nit velikost p\u237?smen\cf3\fs20\par

\cf0\b0 Opakovan\u233? zvolen\u237? tohoto p\u345?\u237?kazu cyklicky st\u345?\u237?d\u225? zm\u283?nu vybran\u233?ho textu na velk\u225?, pak mal\u225? a pak sm\u237?\u353?en\u225? p\u237?smena.\par

\par


\pard\li240\cf5\b\fs18 Shift+F3\f2\fs20  \cf0\b0 / \cf4 MMEditCycleCase\cf5\b\par


\pard\cf0\b0\f0\par

\par

\cf1\ul\b\v\fs26\'11B24\'12\v0 B\u237?l\u233? znaky\cf3\ulnone\fs20\par

\cf0\b0 Zobraz\u237? podnab\u237?dku s p\u345?\u237?kazem pro \u250?pravu b\u237?l\u253?ch znak\u367? (mezer a tabul\u225?tor\u367?) ve vybran\u253?ch \u345?\u225?dc\u237?ch, nebo v cel\u233?m uzlu, pokud nen\u237? vybr\u225?n \u382?\u225?dn\u253? text.\par

\par

\cf1\b\v\fs26\'11B25\'12\v0 O\u345?\u237?znout zleva\cf3\fs20\par

\cf0\b0 Odstran\u237? b\u237?l\u233? znaky vlevo od prvn\u237?ho p\u237?smene ve vybran\u253?ch \u345?\u225?dc\u237?ch, nebo v cel\u233?m uzlu, pokud nen\u237? vybr\u225?n \u382?\u225?dn\u253? text.\par

\par


\pard\li240\cf4\f2 MMEditTrimLeft\cf5\b\par


\pard\cf0\b0\f0\par

\par

\cf1\b\v\fs26\'11B26\'12\v0 O\u345?\u237?znout zprava\cf3\fs20\par

\cf0\b0 Odstran\u237? b\u237?l\u233? znaky vpravo od posledn\u237?ho p\u237?smene ve vybran\u253?ch \u345?\u225?dc\u237?ch, nebo v cel\u233?m uzlu, pokud nen\u237? vybr\u225?n \u382?\u225?dn\u253? text.\par

\par


\pard\li240\cf4\f2 MMEditTrimRight\cf5\b\par


\pard\cf0\b0\f0\par

\par

\cf1\b\v\fs26\'11B27\'12\v0 O\u345?\u237?znout z obou stran\cf3\fs20\par

\cf0\b0 Odstran\u237? b\u237?l\u233? znaky vlevo od prvn\u237?ho p\u237?smene a vpravo od posledn\u237?ho p\u237?smene ve vybran\u253?ch \u345?\u225?dc\u237?ch, nebo v cel\u233?m uzlu, pokud nen\u237? vybr\u225?n \u382?\u225?dn\u253? text.\par

\par


\pard\li240\cf4\f2 MMEditTrimBoth\cf5\b\par


\pard\cf0\b0\f0\par

\par

\cf1\b\v\fs26\'11B28\'12\v0 Zkomprimovat b\u237?l\u233? znaky\cf3\fs20\par

\cf0\b0 Zkomprimuje v\u353?echny b\u237?l\u233? znaky na jednu mezeru (nebo tabul\u225?tor, pokud jsou v textu tabul\u225?tory, ale \u382?\u225?dn\u233? mezery) ve vybran\u253?ch \u345?\u225?dc\u237?ch, nebo v cel\u233?m uzlu, pokud nen\u237? vybr\u225?n \u382?\u225?dn\u253? text.\par

\par


\pard\li240\cf4\f2 MMEditCompress\cf5\b\par


\pard\cf0\b0\f0\par

\par

\cf1\ul\b\v\fs26\'11B29\'12\v0 Transformace\cf3\ulnone\fs20\par

\cf0\b0 Zobraz\u237? podnab\u237?dku s p\u345?\u237?kazy pro transformaci textu.\par

\par

\cf1\b\v\fs26\'11B30\'12\v0 Pou\u382?\u237?t Rot-13\cf3\fs20\par

\cf0\b0 Transformuje text pomoc\u237? ROT-13. \par

Jde o starou techniku zaml\u382?ov\u225?n\u237? textu, kter\u225? sah\u225? a\u382? do ran\u253?ch dob Usenetu. NEN\u205? to \u353?ifrov\u225?n\u237?. M\u367?\u382?ete ji pou\u382?\u237?t k zamaskov\u225?n\u237? textu tak, aby ten, kdo text zobrazuje, musel text znovu podrobit transformaci ROT-13, aby jej p\u345?e\u269?etl. \par

V\u237?ce informac\u237? naleznete v {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK http://catb.org/~esr/jargon/html/entry/rot13.html }}{\fldrslt{http://catb.org/~esr/jargon/html/entry/rot13.html}}}}}\f0\fs20 .\par

\par


\pard\li240\cf5\b\fs18 Shift+Ctrl+3\f2\fs20  \cf0\b0 / \cf4 MMEditRot13\cf5\b\par


\pard\cf0\b0\f0\par

\par

\cf1\b\v\fs26\'11B31\'12\v0 Obr\u225?tit text\cf3\fs20\par

\cf0\b0 Obr\u225?t\u237? po\u345?ad\u237? vybran\u233?ho textu.\par

Pokud vyberete v\u237?ce \u345?\u225?dk\u367?, obr\u225?t\u237? se i po\u345?ad\u237? \u345?\u225?dk\u367?.\par

\par


\pard\li240\cf5\b\fs18 Shift+Ctrl+4\f2\fs20  \cf0\b0 / \cf4 MMEditReverse\cf5\b\par


\pard\cf0\b0\f0\par

\par

\cf1\b\v\fs26\'11B32\'12\v0 Des\u237?tkov\u233? na \u345?\u237?msk\u233?\cf3\fs20\par

\cf0\b0 P\u345?evede vybran\u233? des\u237?tkov\u233? \u269?\u237?slo na \u345?\u237?msk\u233? \u269?\u237?slice. \par

12 se zm\u283?n\u237? na XII. Pokud nen\u237? vybr\u225?no \u382?\u225?dn\u233? \u269?\u237?slo, zobraz\u237? se dialogov\u233? okno, do kter\u233?ho m\u367?\u382?ete zadat des\u237?tkov\u233? \u269?\u237?slo.\par

\par


\pard\li240\cf4\f2 MMEditDecimalToRoman\cf5\b\par


\pard\cf0\b0\f0\par

\par

\cf1\b\v\fs26\'11B33\'12\v0 \u344?\u237?msk\u233? na des\u237?tkov\u233?\cf3\fs20\par

\cf0\b0 P\u345?evede vybran\u233? \u345?\u237?msk\u233? \u269?\u237?slice na des\u237?tkov\u233? \u269?\u237?slo.\par

XII se zm\u283?n\u237? na 12. Pokud nen\u237? vybr\u225?no \u382?\u225?dn\u233? \u269?\u237?slo, zobraz\u237? se dialogov\u233? okno, do kter\u233?ho m\u367?\u382?ete zadat des\u237?tkov\u233? \u269?\u237?slo.\par

\par


\pard\li240\cf4\f2 MMEditRomanToDecimal\cf5\b\par


\pard\cf0\b0\f0\par

\par

\cf1\ul\b\v\fs26\'11B34\'12\v0 V\u253?razy\cf3\ulnone\fs20\par

\cf0\b0 Zobraz\u237? podnab\u237?dku s p\u345?\u237?kazy pro vyhodnocov\u225?n\u237? v\u253?raz\u367?.\par

\par

\cf1\b\v\fs26\'11B35\'12\v0 Vyhodnotit\cf3\fs20\par

\cf0\b0 Vyhodnot\u237? vybran\u253? \u269?\u237?seln\u253? v\u253?raz a p\u345?ipoj\u237? v\u253?sledek na konec vybran\u233?ho textu. Pokud nen\u237? vybr\u225?n \u382?\u225?dn\u253? v\u253?raz, vyhodnot\u237? v\u253?raz na \u345?\u225?dku s kurzorem a p\u345?ipoj\u237? v\u253?sledek.\par

\par


\pard\li240\cf5\b\fs18 Ctrl+ +=\f2\fs20  \cf0\b0 / \cf4 MMEditEvaluate\cf5\b\par


\pard\cf0\b0\f0\par

\par

\cf1\b\v\fs26\'11B36\'12\v0 Vlo\u382?it posledn\u237? v\u253?sledek\cf3\fs20\par

\cf0\b0 Vlo\u382?\u237? v\u253?sledek posledn\u237?ho vyhodnocen\u237? v\u253?razu na pozici kurzoru.\par

\par


\pard\li240\cf5\b\fs18 Alt+Ins\f2\fs20  \cf0\b0 / \cf4 MMEditPasteEval\cf5\b\par


\pard\cf0\b0\f0\par

\par

\cf1\b\v\fs26\'11B37\'12\v0 Vybrat slovo\cf3\fs20\par

\cf0\b0 Vybere slovo, na kter\u233?m je kurzor. \par

Aktivn\u237? m\u367?\u382?e b\u253?t bu\u271? panel stromu, nebo editor.\par

\par


\pard\li240\cf5\b\fs18 Ctrl+Alt+W\f2\fs20  \cf0\b0 / \cf4 MMEditSelectWord\cf5\b\par


\pard\cf0\b0\f0\par

\par

\cf1\b\v\fs26\'11B38\'12\v0 Kop\u237?rovat v\u353?e\cf3\fs20\par

\cf0\b0 Vybere ve\u353?ker\u253? text v aktivn\u237? pozn\u225?mce a zkop\u237?ruje jej do schr\u225?nky.\par

Aktivn\u237? m\u367?\u382?e b\u253?t bu\u271? panel stromu, nebo editor.\par

\par


\pard\li240\cf4\f2 MMEditCopyAll\cf5\b\par


\pard\cf0\b0\f0\par

\par

\cf1\b\v\fs26\'11B1\'12\v0 Vybrat v\u353?e\cf3\fs20\par

