Aktivn\u237? m\u367?\u382?e b\u253?t bu\u271? panel stromu, nebo editor.\par

\par


\pard\li240\cf5\b\fs18 Ctrl+A\f2\fs20  \cf0\b0 / \cf4 MMEditSelectAll\cf5\b\par


