\pard\sb40 Aktivovat re\u382?im, kter\u253? automaticky skr\u253?v\u225? za\u353?krtnut\u233? uzly. Jakmile m\u225?te ve stromu zobrazena za\u353?krt\u225?vac\u237? pol\u237?\u269?ka, u v\u353?ech uzl\u367? nebo jen u potomk\u367? vybran\u253?ch uzl\u367?, bude uzel p\u345?i ka\u382?d\u233?m za\u353?krtnut\u237? skryt. Nav\u237?c budou skryty v\u353?echny ji\u382? ozna\u269?en\u233? uzly. (Viz {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<27|13504|0|11"}}{\fldrslt{Pou\u382?\u237?v\u225?n\u237? skryt\u253?ch uzl\u367?}}}}}\f0\fs20 )\par


\pard\sb80\b Tip\b0 : S \cf5\b Ctrl\cf0\b0 : zobrazit nefiltrovan\u233? uzly. \par


\pard\par


