\cf1\b\v\fs26\lang1033\'11B2\'12\v0 Ozna\u269?it um\u237?st\u283?n\u237? KeyNote\cf3\fs20\par

\cf0\b0 T\u237?mto p\u345?\u237?kazem do\u269?asn\u283? ozna\u269?\u237?te aktu\u225?ln\u237? uzel nebo pozn\u225?mku. \par

Pot\u233? m\u367?\u382?ete p\u345?ej\u237?t do jin\u233?ho uzlu nebo pozn\u225?mky a pomoc\u237? p\u345?\u237?kazu {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<112|2401|0|1"}}{\fldrslt{Vlo\u382?it odkaz KeyNote}}}}}\f0\fs20  vlo\u382?it odkaz zp\u283?t na ozna\u269?en\u233? um\u237?st\u283?n\u237?.\par

\par


