Zvolte p\u345?\u237?kaz \b N\u225?stroje| Konfigurace\b0  Mo\u382?nosti, nastaven\u237? {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<99|0|0"}}{\fldrslt{Pokro\u269?il\u233?}}}}}\f0\fs20 , a vyberte volbu Dialogy pro v\u253?b\u283?r barvy ve star\u233?m stylu, aby se p\u345?i zvolen\u237? p\u345?\u237?kazu \b Barva pozad\u237?\b0  zobrazil dialog pro v\u253?b\u283?r barvy.\par


\pard\fi-320\li680\sb80\b Tip: \b0 Barvu pozad\u237? lze \b zm\u283?nit pro V\u352?ECHNY UZLY ve stromu\b0 : podr\u382?te kl\u225?vesu \cf5\b Shift\cf0\b0  a p\u345?itom zvolte {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<113|14103|0|40"}}{\fldrslt{Form\u225?t | Barva pozad\u237?}}}}}\f0\fs20 . KeyNote v\u225?s pak upozorn\u237?, \u382?e nov\u225? barva bude pou\u382?ita na v\u353?echny uzly stromu, a m\u367?\u382?ete ji potvrdit nebo zru\u353?it.\par


\pard\par


