Zvolte p\u345?\u237?kaz \b N\u225?stroje | Volby konfigurace\b0 , nastaven\u237? {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<99|0|0"}}{\fldrslt{Pokro\u269?il\u233?}}}}}\f0\fs20  a vyberte mo\u382?nost Dialog v\u253?b\u283?ru barev star\u233?ho stylu, aby se p\u345?i volb\u283? p\u345?\u237?kazu \b Pou\u382?\u237?t zv\u253?razn\u283?n\u237?\b0  zobrazil dialog pro v\u253?b\u283?r barvy.\par

