\pard\par


\pard\fi-2160\li2160\sa100\par


\pard\cf1\b\v\fs26\'11B1\'12\v0 Nov\u225? slo\u382?ka...\cf3\fs20\par

\cf0\b0 Vytvo\u345?\u237? novou slo\u382?ku. \par

Pozn\u225?mka bude m\u237?t panel stromu a bude obsahovat po\u269?\u225?te\u269?n\u237? uzel. Tento panel stromu lze skr\u253?t.\par

\par

Viz tak\u233?: {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<13|0|0"}}{\fldrslt{Definice}}}}}\f0\fs20\lang3082  \lang1033\par

\par


\pard\li240\v\'11I8\'12\v0\lang3082{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "img:8,16,16"}}{\fldrslt {8_Main_08.png}}}}\lang1033  \cf4\f2\lang3082 TB_NoteNew\tab\tab\cf5\b\f0\fs18\lang1033 Ctrl+N\f2\fs20  \cf0\b0 / \cf4 MMNoteNew\cf5\b\par


