\par


\pard\li240\v\'11I9\'12\v0\lang3082{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "img:9,16,16"}}{\fldrslt {9_Main_09.png}}}}\lang1033  \cf4\f2\lang3082 TB_FileInfo\tab\tab\cf5\b\f0\fs18\lang1033 F4\f2\fs20  \cf0\b0 / \cf4 MMNoteProperties\cf5\b\par


\pard\cf0\b0\f0\par

\lang3082\par

\cf1\b\v\fs26\lang1033\'11B4\'12\v0 Odebrat slo\u382?ku\cf3\fs20\par

\cf0\b0 Odstran\u237? aktivn\u237? slo\u382?ku.\par

\par


\pard\li240\cf6 Upozorn\u283?n\u237?: Jakmile slo\u382?ku odstran\u237?te, nem\u367?\u382?ete ji vr\u225?tit zp\u283?t!\cf0\par


\pard\par


\pard\li240\v\'11I10\'12\v0\lang3082{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "img:10,16,16"}}{\fldrslt {10_Main_10.png}}}}\lang1033  \cf4\f2\lang3082 TB_NoteDelete\cf5\b\lang1033\par


\pard\cf0\b0\f0\par

\lang3082\par

\cf1\b\fs26\lang1033 N\u225?hled p\u345?ed tiskem\cf3\fs20\par

\cf0\b0 Zobraz\u237?, jak se bude slo\u382?ka tisknout. Souvis\u237? s p\u345?\u237?kazem Slo\u382?ka | Tisk slo\u382?ky...\par

\par


\pard\li240\cf4\f2 MMNotePrintPreview_\cf5\b\par


\pard\cf0\b0\f0\lang3082\par

\par

\cf1\b\v\fs26\lang1033\'11B5\'12\v0 Tisk slo\u382?ky...\cf3\fs20\par

\cf0\b0 Vytiskne aktivn\u237? slo\u382?ku.\par

M\u367?\u382?ete zvolit tisk pouze vybran\u233?ho uzlu, v\u353?ech uzl\u367? ve slo\u382?ce, souvisl\u253?ch uzl\u367? nebo v\u353?ech uzl\u367? ve slo\u382?ce za\u269?\u237?naj\u237?c\u237?ch na nov\u233? str\u225?nce. T\u237?mto zp\u367?sobem se nezahrne z\u225?pat\u237? ani z\u225?hlav\u237? str\u225?nky, pouze text uzl\u367?.\par


\pard\sb120 Pozn\u225?mka: Mnohem v\u237?ce mo\u382?nost\u237? nab\u237?z\u237? p\u345?\u237?kaz \b Soubor | Tisk...\b0  (nebo Soubor | Exportovat...). Viz {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<57|4839|0|13"}}{\fldrslt{Tisk pozn\u225?mek (export do tisk\u225?rny)}}}}}\f0\fs20\par


\pard\par

Viz tak\u233?: {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<13|0|0"}}{\fldrslt{Definice}}}}}\f0\fs20\lang3082  \lang1033\par

\par


\pard\li240\v\f3\'11I45\'12\v0\f0\lang3082{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "img:45,16,16"}}{\fldrslt {45_Main_45.png}}}}\f3\lang1033  \cf4\f2\lang3082 TB_Print\tab\tab\cf5\b\f0\fs18\lang1033 Shift+Ctrl+P\f2\fs20  \cf0\b0 / \cf4 MMNotePrint\cf5\b\par


\pard\cf0\b0\f0\par

\lang3082\par

\par

\cf1\b\v\fs26\lang1033\'11B7\'12\v0 Sb\u283?r ze schr\u225?nky\cf3\fs20\par

\cf0\b0 Vlo\u382?\u237? v\u353?e zkop\u237?rovan\u233? do schr\u225?nky Windows do aktu\u225?ln\u237?ho souboru .knt. Zahrnuje to text i obr\u225?zky. KeyNote zv\u253?razn\u237? kartu pou\u382?itou jako slo\u382?ku pro sb\u283?r.\par

\par

Je-li panel stromu skryt\u253?, p\u345?i ka\u382?d\u233?m zkop\u237?rov\u225?n\u237? n\u283?\u269?eho do schr\u225?nky se obsah vlo\u382?\u237? do vybran\u233?ho uzlu na samostatn\u253? \u345?\u225?dek.\par

Je-li panel stromu viditeln\u253?, je mo\u382?n\u233? nastavit, \u382?e p\u345?i ka\u382?d\u233?m zkop\u237?rov\u225?n\u237? n\u283?\u269?eho do schr\u225?nky se obsah vlo\u382?\u237? do nov\u233?ho uzlu ve slo\u382?ce.\par


\pard\sb120 Tuto funkci m\u367?\u382?ete p\u345?izp\u367?sobit v nab\u237?dce \b N\u225?stroje | {\b0{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<101|1152|0|2"}}{\fldrslt{Mo\u382?nosti konfigurace}}}}}\f0\fs20 .\b0  M\u367?\u382?ete nap\u345?\u237?klad sb\u237?rat do jedin\u233?ho uzlu nam\u237?sto do samostatn\u253?ch uzl\u367?.\par


\pard\par

\b Tip\b0 : Tento p\u345?\u237?kaz z\u367?st\u225?v\u225? aktivn\u237?, dokud jej znovu nezvol\u237?te pro vypnut\u237?. C\u237?lov\u225? slo\u382?ka pro sb\u283?r ze schr\u225?nky mus\u237? b\u253?t aktivn\u237?, abyste sb\u283?r mohli vypnout (jinak se pouze zm\u283?n\u237? slo\u382?ka pro sb\u283?r).\par

\par

V\u237?ce informac\u237? v {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<35|0|0"}}{\fldrslt{Pou\u382?\u237?v\u225?n\u237? zachycen\u237? schr\u225?nky}}}}}\f0\fs20  \par

\par


\pard\li240\v\f3\'11I19\'12\v0\f0\lang3082{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "img:19,16,16"}}{\fldrslt {19_Main_19.png}}}}\f3\lang1033  \cf4\f2\lang3082 TB_ClipCap\tab\tab\cf5\b\f0\fs18\lang1033 F11\f2\fs20  \cf0\b0 / \cf4 MMNoteClipCapture\cf5\b\par


\pard\cf0\b0\f0\par

\lang3082\par

\cf1\b\v\fs26\lang1033\'11B8\'12\v0 Kontrola pravopisu\cf3\fs20\par

\cf0\b0 Zkontroluje pravopis ve\u353?ker\u233?ho textu na panelu editoru.\par

V po\u269?\u237?ta\u269?i mus\u237?te m\u237?t nainstalov\u225?no jedno z n\u225?sleduj\u237?c\u237?ho:\par


\pard{\pntext\f4\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf4\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\fi-360\li360  Microsoft Word 97 nebo nov\u283?j\u353?\u237?\par

{\pntext\f4\'B7\tab} slovn\u237?k WordWeb (viz {\lang3082{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<26|0|0"}}{\fldrslt{Integrace s tezaurem WordWeb}}}}}\f0\fs20 )\par


\pard\par

\b Tip\b0 : Aby kontrola pravopisu fungovala spr\u225?vn\u283?, mus\u237?te ur\u269?it jazyk pozn\u225?mky. V\u253?choz\u237? jazyk pro nov\u233? pozn\u225?mky m\u367?\u382?ete vybrat, nebo vybrat text v existuj\u237?c\u237? pozn\u225?mce a nastavit jeho jazyk, aby kontrola pravopisu mohla vybrat spr\u225?vn\u253? slovn\u237?k, pomoc\u237? \ul Form\u225?t | Jazyk...\ulnone  (Viz {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "file:///<30|0|0"}}{\fldrslt{Vlastnosti pozn\u225?mky}}}}}\f0\fs20 )\par

\par

\par


\pard\li240\v\f3\'11I44\'12\v0\f0\lang3082{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "img:44,16,16"}}{\fldrslt {44_Main_44.png}}}}\f3\lang1033  \cf4\f2\lang3082 TB_Spell\tab\tab\lang1033 MMNoteSpell\cf5\b\par


\pard\cf0\b0\f0\par

\lang3082\par

\cf1\b\v\fs26\lang1033\'11B9\'12\v0 Jen pro \u269?ten\u237?\cf3\fs20\par

\cf0\b0 P\u345?ep\u237?n\u225? slo\u382?ku mezi \ldblquote jen pro \u269?ten\u237?\rdblquote  a \ldblquote pro z\u225?pis\rdblquote .\par

Slo\u382?ka jen pro \u269?ten\u237? br\u225?n\u237? ostatn\u237?m (i v\u225?m samotn\u253?m!), aby omylem zm\u283?nili informace v pozn\u225?mce (uzlu) t\u233?to slo\u382?ky.\par

\par

\b Tip: \b0 Tato pozn\u225?mka z\u367?stane jen pro \u269?ten\u237?, dokud p\u345?\u237?kaz znovu nezvol\u237?te, abyste ji u\u269?inili zapisovatelnou.\par

\par


\pard\li240\cf5\b\fs18 Shift+Ctrl+R\f2\fs20  \cf0\b0 / \cf4 MMNoteReadOnly\cf5\b\par


\pard\cf0\b0\f0\par

\par


\pard\fi-2160\li2160\sa100 - - - - - - - - - - - - - - \par


\pard\cf7\b\v\fs26\'11B6\'12\v0 Pozn\u225?mka e-mailem...\cf3\fs20\par

\cf0\b0 Ode\u353?le aktu\u225?ln\u237? slo\u382?ku nebo v\u353?echny slo\u382?ky v aktivn\u237?m souboru KeyNote e-mailem.\par

\par


\pard\li240\b Pozn\u225?mka: \b0 P\u345?ed odesl\u225?n\u237?m e-mailu mus\u237?te na kart\u283? Server SMTP zadat nastaven\u237? SMTP.\par

\par

\cf6 Pozn\u225?mka\cf0\b :\b0  \cf3\ul Moment\u225?ln\u283? nedostupn\u233?\cf0\ulnone\par


\pard\par


\pard\li240\v\'11I18\'12\v0\lang3082{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "img:18,16,16"}}{\fldrslt {18_Main_18.png}}}}\lang1033  \cf4\f2\lang3082 TB_EmailNote\tab\tab\cf5\b\f0\fs18\lang1033 Shift+Ctrl+Alt+E\f2\fs20  \cf0\b0 / \cf4 MMNoteEmail\cf5\b\par


\pard\fi-2160\li2160\sa100\cf0\b0\f0\par

}
