\lang3082\par

\cf1\b\v\fs26\lang1033\'11B32\'12\v0 Se\u345?adit cel\u253? strom\cf3\fs20\par

\cf0\b0 Se\u345?ad\u237? v\u353?echny \cf4 uzly\cf0  ve stromu slo\u382?ky (alfanumerick\u233? \u345?azen\u237?).\par

\par


\pard\li240\cf7 Upozorn\u283?n\u237?: P\u345?\u237?kaz Se\u345?adit nelze vr\u225?tit zp\u283?t.\cf0\par


